{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L0phY2tyYWJiaXQlMjAlMjgyMDE1JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Jackrabbit","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/uTbcoBZeClVyoLfhWXjxjWoPu2i.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cd9lvcw4SBIjNM3BDAFd4VduwW9.jpg","description":"Following a worldwide event known as The Reset, humanity rebuilds a society with aging mechanics where gleaming technology once stood. Surveillance now the status quo, society is slowly putting its shattered pieces back together under a watchful eye. After a friend’s suicide leaves behind a mysterious computer drive, a young computer prodigy and a shadowy hacker join together to decipher the clues that he’s left behind. The youthful creators of Jackrabbit have successfully constructed a world, which we haven’t previously seen on film. Mixing retro production design with slick storytelling, they deliver a cinematic dissonance that will result in a shock to the senses.\n\nReleased 18 Apr 2015 · United States of America · Language: English · 101 min\nStudio: Gravitas Ventures, Vopo Technologies\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2015","genres":["Drama","Thriller","Science Fiction","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"4.5","runtime":"101 min","cast":["Josh Caras","Ian Christopher Noel","Joslyn Jensen","Reed Birney","Robert Ansley","Cameron Covert","Regina Ting Chen","Graham Cumberbatch"],"director":["Carleton Ranney"],"released":"2015-04-18T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Carleton Ranney","character":"Director"},{"name":"Josh Caras","character":"Simon","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/AnxheIDGQs7Yh4imALUrcWkpTmq.jpg"},{"name":"Ian Christopher Noel","character":"Max"},{"name":"Joslyn Jensen","character":"Grace","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wGqbnUN5ny906nheuooCiBACJG2.jpg"},{"name":"Reed Birney","character":"Paul Bateson","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dfLgNLUt6Xs2MJJTi6B1iWdXjU6.jpg"},{"name":"